# Lets search tools that read this file, such as ripgrep and Claude Code's Grep, into the
# copies of the dependencies' docs that harnesspm writes to node_modules/.harnesspm/docs/.
# The rest of node_modules stays out of search. See docs/rules/harness.md.
!/node_modules/
/node_modules/*
!/node_modules/.harnesspm/
/node_modules/.harnesspm/*
!/node_modules/.harnesspm/docs/
